s="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-27_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-28_"><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-29_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-31_">We’re all guilty of letting our photos accumulate inside our phones. We take what seems like a million photos at a special event or during a family vacation and trust that our phones will protect our special memories.<br><br>But did you know that <span style="font-weight: bold;">over 95 million phones are damaged beyond repair each year</span>, just from dropping them? This means that the beautiful photos of your daughter’s graduation ceremony or grandson’s talent show could be lost forever, simply because you dropped your phone!<br><br>And this large number of damaged phones doesn’t even include the phones lost for other reasons, such as water damage or technical errors.<br><br>Spare yourself the heartache of losing your favorite photos and back them up easily and instantly with <span style="font-weight: bold;">ThePhotoStick Mobile</span>!</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-eJwWfJ gOTWZO pf-32_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-jeraig gFfZqp"><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-33_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-34_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ezbkAF deEGdS pf-35_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-37_">What is ThePhotoStick Mobile?</span></h2><a data-action="url" href="/pages/shop-thephotostick-for-mobile" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-hiCibw ekDlzN pf-38_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-f6f69464--photostickmobile02.jpg?v=1618269185" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-f6f69464--photostickmobile02.jpg?v=1618269185 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-f6f69464--photostickmobile02_500x.jpg?v=1618269185 320w" width="800" height="523" class="sc-jJoQJp hALhgP"/></a><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-39_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-41_">Imagine having the capability to sort through each of your photos and videos with little to no effort AND being able to keep these memories tucked safely away - That’s ThePhotoStick Mobile!<br><br>With <span style="font-weight: bold;">ThePhotoStick Mobile</span> you can save tens of thousands of photos and/or videos and never have to worry about losing them should something terrible happen to your mobile device.<br><br>It’s simply a tiny USB that you can easily fit right into your pocket or even attach to a keychain, making it easy for anyone to hang onto.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-42_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-43_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ezbkAF deEGdS pf-44_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-46_">How Does It Work?</span></h2></div></div></div><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-47_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-48_"><a data-action="url" href="/pages/shop-thephotostick-for-mobile" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-hiCibw ekDlzN pf-49_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-4a0cf6f6--photostickmobile04.jpg?v=1618263254" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/pf-4a0cf6f6--photostickmobile04.jpg?v=1618263254 1536w" width="396" height="396" class="sc-jJoQJp hALhgP"/></a><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-50_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-52_">Using <span style="font-weight: bold;">The PhotoStick Mobile</span> is easy as 1-2-3!<br><br>When you receive yours, you will notice that one end of the handy USB plugs directly into your phone.<br><br>Once you’ve connected ThePhotoStick Mobile to your device, simply download the free app and you’ll instantly be ready to begin adding your photos. It really is that simple!<br><br>And getting your photos from your phone to your computer or other device is just as easy.<br><br>The other end of ThePhotoStick Mobile fits perfectly into your computer’s USB port, enabling you to quickly transfer each and every photo with the click of a button.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-eJwWfJ gOTWZO pf-53_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-jeraig gFfZqp"><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-54_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-55_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ezbkAF deEGdS pf-56_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-58_">Back-Up Your Memories Now!</span></h2><div data-pf-type="Youtube" class="sc-GEbAx jjirLq pf-59_"><div style="position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%"><iframe class="pf-ifr" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/TruogC-FtDA?start=0&autoplay=0&loop=0&mute=0&controls=0&enablejsapi=1" allowfullscreen="" width="560" height="315" allow="autoplay" title="yt-video"></iframe></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-eJwWfJ gOTWZO pf-60_"><div style="--cw:1000px" class="sc-jeraig gFfZqp"><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-61_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-62_"><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-63_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-65_">Don’t wait for a catastrophe to strike! Easily transfer the family photos from your phone, safely onto your computer, and know that your precious memories will remain secure on <span style="font-weight: bold;">ThePhotoStick Mobile</span>.<br><br>The best part? <span style="font-weight: bold;">You can get The PhotoStick Mobile for under $100!</span><br><br>Complicated external hard drives can easily cost triple the price of ThePhotoStick Mobile so you don’t want to miss out on this amazing deal!</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-66_ animate-grow pf-r pf-r-eh pf-hide" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row" data-animation="zoomIn"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-67_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ezbkAF deEGdS pf-68_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-70_">***SPECIAL OFFER***</span></h2><p class="sc-gGCDDS lbFTHT pf-71_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-73_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">As of today, you can still get ThePhotoStick Mobile with 32GB of storage for 40% OFF! For only $59.99, you get:</span><br><br>- Safe storage of 15,000 of photos &amp; videos<br>- One-click uploading<br>- Instant filtering of duplicate photos<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">Get yours before this offer ends!</span></span></p><a href="/pages/shop-thephotostick-for-mobile" target="_blank" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-hGPBjI dSAeLN pf-74_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-76_"><b>Get 40% Off</b></span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-eJwWfJ gOTWZO pf-77_ pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-jeraig gFfZqp"><div class="sc-dJjYzT drCpbA pf-78_ pf-r pf-r-eh pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jgrJph gHStpP pf-79_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-ezbkAF deEGdS pf-80_"><span data